    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Know That Flag!', you're not just guessing. We've crafted five innovative game modes to challenge every aspect of your flag knowledge:&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Challenge (Flag to Country):</strong> The classic test \u2013 see a flag, pick the country. Simple, but endlessly fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reverse Recall (Country to Flag):</strong> Can you picture the flag just from the country's name? A true memory challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language Link:</strong> Connect a country's official language to its flag. Expand your cultural insights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currency Quest:</strong> Match flags to their unique currencies. A fascinating blend of geography and economics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capital Connection:</strong> Identify the flag by knowing its capital city. Prove your geographical expertise!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Know That Flag!', you're not just guessing. We've crafted five innovative game modes to challenge every aspect of your flag knowledge:&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Challenge (Flag to Country):</strong> The classic test \u2013 see a flag, pick the country. Simple, but endlessly fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reverse Recall (Country to Flag):</strong> Can you picture the flag just from the country's name? A true memory challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language Link:</strong> Connect a country's official language to its flag. Expand your cultural insights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currency Quest:</strong> Match flags to their unique currencies. A fascinating blend of geography and economics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capital Connection:</strong> Identify the flag by knowing its capital city. Prove your geographical expertise!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Challenge your global knowledge with Know That Flag!, the ultimate flag quiz game offering five unique modes \u2013 from guessing countries by their currency to identifying flags by their capital cities.",
